@ [source] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-07-30_cantor_m2b_windows_platform_preflight_runtime\Cantor_M2B_Windows_Platform_Preflight_Runtime_Source.sop
@ [forms_authority] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_M2B_Platform_Preflight_Fault_Provenance_Revision.sop

& [Conflict] is structural
  + [source_intent] zero immediate error capture must never become an operating-system fault with a fabricated nonzero code
  + [result_constraint] open_fault and query_fault require a nonzero error code
  + [result_constraint] observation_fault requires one of four query stages and has no open stage
  + [consequence] a failed CreateFileW followed by zero GetLastError cannot inhabit any honest profile 0.2 result variant

& [RejectedInterpretation] is false provenance
  + [option] map zero open error to observation_fault at an unrelated query stage
  + [rejection] that invents both causal stage and result meaning
  + [option] substitute ERROR_INVALID_DATA or another familiar nonzero code
  + [rejection] that invents an operating-system report

& [Decision] is a runtime-layer provenance fault
  + [variant] is OperatingSystemErrorUnavailable
  + [operation] is Open or Query with the exact PlatformPreflightQueryStage
  + [error_code] is absent
  + [partial_evidence] is absent
  + [result_claim] is absent
  + [effect] the handle owner still drops normally if acquisition had succeeded

& [Boundary] is narrow
  + [forms] remain unchanged and proven
  + [normal_nonzero_error] remains open_fault or query_fault
  + [local_success_processing_failure] remains observation_fault
  + [zero_after_reported_failure] alone uses the runtime provenance fault
  + [scanner_or_receipt_authority] is absent

& [SJSConsequence] is required
  + [canonical] must refine the raw phrase zero error maps to invalid_observation where that phrase is structurally impossible
  + [tests] must prove zero cannot become an OS error or an invented query stage
  + [invalidation] any synthesized code or stage invalidates the runtime signature
